  ["Hello, hello! I'm\nthe NAME RATER.\n\nI rate the names\nof #MON.\n\nWould you like me\nto rate names?"] = "",
  ["Hi! Welcome home!\nYou're trying very\011hard, I see.\012I've kept your\nroom tidy.\012Or is this about\nyour money?"] = "",
